OL,3,GNEWSASupreme Court asked to settle
OL,4,Adispute over Sturgeon inquiry documents
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK's Supreme Court is being asked
OL,7,Fto rule on the Scottish government's
OL,8,Frefusal to release documents linked to
OL,9,Fan inquiry that cleared Nicola Sturgeon
OL,10,Fof breaching the ministerial code.
OL,12,FMinisters have cited legal professional
OL,13,Fprivilege as grounds for refusing a
OL,14,Ffreedom of information (FOI) request
OL,15,Ffrom a member of the public.
OL,17,FBenjamin Harrop was seeking internal
OL,18,Femails, messages and other
OL,19,Fcommunications about whether the
OL,20,Fgovernment had a legal right to
OL,21,Fwithhold the material.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
