OL,3,GNEWSASupreme Court asked to settle
OL,4,Adispute over Sturgeon inquiry documents
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Court of Session later overturned a
OL,7,Fruling by Information Commissioner
OL,8,FDavid Hamilton that the documents
OL,9,Fshould be released, but Hamilton is now
OL,10,Fseeking permission to take the case to
OL,11,Fthe UK's highest court.
